GET students/_search
{
  "size": 0,
  "aggs": {
    "extended_stats_gpa": {
      "extended_stats": {
        "field": "gpa",
        "missing": 0
      }
    }
  }
}
```
{% include copy-curl.html %}

In the response, all missing values of `gpa` are replaced with `0`:

