    {"token": "görüyor","start_offset": 42,"end_offset": 49,"type": "<ALPHANUM>","position": 4},
    {"token": "numar","start_offset": 51,"end_offset": 57,"type": "<ALPHANUM>","position": 5},
    {"token": "123456","start_offset": 58,"end_offset": 64,"type": "<NUM>","position": 6}
  ]
}
```

